{%- comment -%}
  URL for the all-collections index page.

  /collections (templates/list-collections.json) and /pages/collections
  (templates/page.collections.json) render the same ncs-collections-index
  section. Linking to both split the same content across two indexable URLs,
  so every internal link now points at Shopify's native /collections route and
  nc-meta-tags canonicalises the page template to match.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  echo routes.collections_url
-%}
